    {
      "text": "WHO Child Growth Standards chart 'Weight-for-age GIRLS, Birth to 5 years (z-scores)' on a pink background. Weight (kg, about 2 to 30) is plotted against age (completed months and years, birth to 5 years), with curved z-score lines labelled 3, 2, 0, −2 and −3 that rise with age.",
